{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-199315-r4518199","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Beef Burgers with Chipotle Mayo","sourcePageId":199315,"sourceRevision":"4518199","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-21T16:18:00Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Beef%20Burgers%20with%20Chipotle%20Mayo&oldid=4518199","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:24:42.134Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Easy recipes","Category:Grilled recipes","Category:Main course recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for hamburgers","Category:Recipes using cayenne","Category:Recipes using cheese","Category:Recipes using chipotle chile","Category:Recipes using ground beef","Category:Recipes using mayonnaise","Category:Recipes with metric units","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"d6838719c0da15abf85b9e5e561a2820f235cd89497ce2da6e97acb99b120310","sourceWikitext":"__NOTOC__\n{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Hamburger recipes\n| Difficulty = 2\n}}\n\n{{recipe}}\n\nBurgers, professional chef style with a chipotle mayo.\n\n== Ingredients ==\n\n=== Chipotle mayo ===\n\n* 6 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|Tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Mayonnaise|mayonnaise]]\n* 2 Tbsp [[Cookbook:Chipotle Pepper|chipotle]] purée\n* [[Cookbook:Salt|Salt]]\n* [[Cookbook:Black Pepper|Black pepper]]\n\n=== Burgers ===\n\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Pound|pound]] (450 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]]) ground [[Cookbook:Beef#Chuck|chuck]]\n* Salt\n* Black pepper\n* [[Cookbook:Cayenne Pepper|Cayenne]] pepper\n* [[Cookbook:Cheese|Cheese]] slices (optional)\n* 4 hamburger buns, split in half\n\n== Procedure ==\n#Mix all ingredients for the chipotle mayo and refrigerate until needed.\n#Shape ground chuck into 4 patties. Sprinkle patties with kosher salt, black pepper, and cayenne pepper.\n#Place patties on a well-oiled medium [[Cookbook:Grill|grill]] and cook until internal temperature reaches 160°F (>70°C) for medium doneness. If using cheese, place on patties and cover for 1 minute to melt the cheese.\n#Spread chipotle mayo onto buns and sandwich the burgers with the halves. Serve.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using ground beef]]\n[[Category:Recipes using mayonnaise]]\n[[Category:Grilled recipes]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes for hamburgers]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cheese]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chipotle chile]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cayenne]]","isRecipe":false,"recipe":{"name":"Beef Burgers with Chipotle Mayo","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[],"steps":[{"n":1,"text":"Mix all ingredients for the chipotle mayo and refrigerate until needed.","sourceText":"Mix all ingredients for the chipotle mayo and refrigerate until needed.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":2,"text":"Shape ground chuck into 4 patties. Sprinkle patties with kosher salt, black pepper, and cayenne pepper.","sourceText":"Shape ground chuck into 4 patties. Sprinkle patties with kosher salt, black pepper, and cayenne pepper.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":3,"text":"Place patties on a well-oiled medium grill and cook until internal temperature reaches 160°F (>70°C) for medium doneness. If using cheese, place on patties and cover for 1 minute to melt the cheese.","sourceText":"Place patties on a well-oiled medium grill and cook until internal temperature reaches 160°F (>70°C) for medium doneness. If using cheese, place on patties and cover for 1 minute to melt the cheese.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":4,"text":"Spread chipotle mayo onto buns and sandwich the burgers with the halves. Serve.","sourceText":"Spread chipotle mayo onto buns and sandwich the burgers with the halves. Serve.","durationMinutes":null}],"nutrition":null,"gaps":["Research extraction only; no culinary/editorial review.","Ingredient quantities, units, alternatives, food identities, aggregate duration, and nutrition remain unknown until individually parsed/reviewed.","Source-level CC BY-SA policy applies generally; page-specific exceptions have not been checked."]}},"parsedRecipe":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"wikibooks:199315","recordId":"wikibooks-199315-r4518199","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceRevision":"4518199","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Beef%20Burgers%20with%20Chipotle%20Mayo&oldid=4518199","sourceSha256":"d6838719c0da15abf85b9e5e561a2820f235cd89497ce2da6e97acb99b120310","parserVersion":"wikibooks-sections-v3","quantityParserVersion":"source-prefix-v2","license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"reviewStatus":"source-extracted-unreview